  "transcript": [
    {
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 10500,
      "text": "Now listen carefully and answer questions one to six."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 10500,
      "endMs": 13460,
      "text": "Woman: Hi Greg, great to see you."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 13460,
      "endMs": 18180,
      "text": "And thanks for emailing me with the details of the horseback riding trip you went on."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 18180,
      "endMs": 21180,
      "text": "I looked at the website and it looks great."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 21180,
      "endMs": 24380,
      "text": "Greg: Yeah, I went on the two day mini-break."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 24380,
      "endMs": 26280,
      "text": "Is that what you're thinking about?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 26280,
      "endMs": 28820,
      "text": "Woman: Yes, that's the one."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 28820,
      "endMs": 33200,
      "text": "Do you think they'd have places now in July or will it be full?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 33200,
      "endMs": 36160,
      "text": "Greg: If you can, hang on till September."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 36160,
      "endMs": 39360,
      "text": "That's when I went and it was a really great time to go."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 39360,
      "endMs": 41560,
      "text": "It's not so hot for a start."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 41560,
      "endMs": 43600,
      "text": "Woman: That'd suit me better anyway."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 43600,
      "endMs": 49240,
      "text": "Greg: And also at one point when we stopped for a picnic, I was lying in a field looking up"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 49240,
      "endMs": 52040,
      "text": "and saw a huge flock of birds."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 52040,
      "endMs": 54120,
      "text": "They were obviously migrating."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 54120,
      "endMs": 56400,
      "text": "That's another reason why it's a good time to go."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 56400,
      "endMs": 57400,
      "text": "Woman: Oh great."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 57400,
      "endMs": 61280,
      "text": "Greg: Oh and another thing, you don't stay in a hotel."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 61280,
      "endMs": 65720,
      "text": "You stay in a tent so you don't have to come back to town in the evening."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 65720,
      "endMs": 67720,
      "text": "Woman: I'm up for that."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 67720,
      "endMs": 71000,
      "text": "So where do you go on the first day?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 71000,
      "endMs": 75880,
      "text": "Greg: Through some amazing wooded valleys full of chestnut and beech trees."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 75880,
      "endMs": 81000,
      "text": "But that's just the morning where you're really heading for is the mountains and when"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 81000,
      "endMs": 84800,
      "text": "you set out you can only see them in the far distance."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 84800,
      "endMs": 87980,
      "text": "You don't actually get there until sunset."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 87980,
      "endMs": 90180,
      "text": "Woman: Is it hard work riding all day?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 90180,
      "endMs": 91180,
      "text": "Greg: No."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 91180,
      "endMs": 97380,
      "text": "The pace is easy and there are plenty of breaks built in for picnics and even a snooze."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 97380,
      "endMs": 101940,
      "text": "But on that first evening when you've been riding all day, you get the opportunity to"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 101940,
      "endMs": 105420,
      "text": "go for a swim and you really enjoy that."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 105420,
      "endMs": 107220,
      "text": "So relaxing."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 107220,
      "endMs": 109580,
      "text": "Woman: And what's on day two?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 109580,
      "endMs": 112180,
      "text": "You said something about the National Park?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 112180,
      "endMs": 113180,
      "text": "Greg: No."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 113180,
      "endMs": 116180,
      "text": "Day two, you go up this incredible valley."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 116180,
      "endMs": 118940,
      "text": "At the end of it, there's a waterfall."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 118940,
      "endMs": 121660,
      "text": "It's an amazing place to stop for lunch."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 121660,
      "endMs": 124980,
      "text": "We even spotted an eagle while we were sitting there."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 124980,
      "endMs": 128700,
      "text": "And in the afternoon, there's a trip that goes to a cave."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 128700,
      "endMs": 130460,
      "text": "You can even ride into it."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 130460,
      "endMs": 131460,
      "text": "Woman: Wow."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 131460,
      "endMs": 132460,
      "text": "That sounds great."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 132460,
      "endMs": 137380,
      "text": "I can't wait."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 137380,
      "endMs": 141880,
      "text": "Before you hear the rest of the conversation, you have some time to look at questions"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 141880,
      "endMs": 163600,
      "text": "7 to 10."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 163600,
      "endMs": 171000,
      "text": "Now listen and answer questions 7 to 10."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 171000,
      "endMs": 172000,
      "text": "Woman: Okay."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 172000,
      "endMs": 175680,
      "text": "So what are your tips for a horseback riding weekend?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 175680,
      "endMs": 181940,
      "text": "Greg: Well, I'd had a sore knee before I went and I was pretty worried about that."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 181940,
      "endMs": 186680,
      "text": "It was okay actually, but what you've got to watch for is that you don't have any trouble"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 186680,
      "endMs": 188520,
      "text": "with your back."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 188520,
      "endMs": 190680,
      "text": "Riding can really aggravate that."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 190680,
      "endMs": 192800,
      "text": "Woman: No problem there."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 192800,
      "endMs": 194920,
      "text": "And comfortable clothes I guess."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 194920,
      "endMs": 195920,
      "text": "Greg: Yeah."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 195920,
      "endMs": 200840,
      "text": "But another thing I hadn't realized is that you actually walk the horses down some pretty"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 200840,
      "endMs": 203480,
      "text": "steep and uneven paths."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 203480,
      "endMs": 207920,
      "text": "So make sure you have walking boots, not just normal riding boots."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 207920,
      "endMs": 212320,
      "text": "And even if you're going in the autumn, make sure you don't get sunburned."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 212320,
      "endMs": 216080,
      "text": "Even if it looks cloudy, take sunscreen, lots of it."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 216080,
      "endMs": 219280,
      "text": "Woman: I think you've convinced me to sign up."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 219280,
      "endMs": 225920,
      "text": "When I was looking at the website, I saw that if I register online, I can get a discount."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 225920,
      "endMs": 229120,
      "text": "Did you do that or go through a travel agency?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 229120,
      "endMs": 231680,
      "text": "Greg: I registered online of course."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 231680,
      "endMs": 236000,
      "text": "Woman: I just have to let my boss know when I want to take time off."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 236000,
      "endMs": 240920,
      "text": "And then the other important thing I read was that you have to make sure that your insurance"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 240920,
      "endMs": 246120,
      "text": "company know that you're going on an adventure trip to make sure that you're covered in"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 246120,
      "endMs": 247720,
      "text": "case anything happens."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 247720,
      "endMs": 254280,
      "text": "Greg: I'm sure it won't, but better be safe than sorry."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 254280,
      "endMs": 256800,
      "text": "That is the end of part one."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 256800,
      "endMs": 260440,
      "text": "You now have one minute to check your answers to part one."
    }
  ],
